ween human qualities, motivations and actions?", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.49805749805749805, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.5112665112665112}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5306915306915307, "x1": 0.6285714285714286, "y1": 0.5439005439005439}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are listed on pages 10-11.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.5811965811965812, "x1": 0.5010989010989011, "y1": 0.5944055944055944}, {"text": "1032 -9-", "x0": 0.08241758241758242, "y0": 0.9432789432789432, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "The prescribed texts for Section II are:", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.4307692307692308, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "Anthony Doerr, All the Light We Cannot See", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.108003108003108, "x1": 0.6736263736263737, "y1": 0.13286713286713286}, {"text": "* Prose Fiction \u2014", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11266511266511267, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.13131313131313133}, {"text": "Amanda Lohrey, Vertigo", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.13908313908313907, "x1": 0.510989010989011, "y1": 0.15151515151515152}, {"text": "George Orwell, Nineteen Eighty-Four", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.6175824175824176, "y1": 0.17482517482517482}, {"text": "Favel Parrett, Past the Shallows", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.18492618492618493, "x1": 0.567032967032967, "y1": 0.19502719502719504}, {"text": "Rosemary Dobson, Rosemary Dobson Collected", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.21833721833721834, "x1": 0.7021978021978021, "y1": 0.23154623154623155}, {"text": "* Poetry -", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2191142191142191, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.23154623154623155}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.24242424242424243, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.25485625485625485}, {"text": "* Young Girl at a Window", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.257964257964258, "x1": 0.5318681318681319, "y1": 0.2828282828282828}, {"text": "* Over the Hill", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.27505827505827507, "x1": 0.44065934065934065, "y1": 0.2999222999222999}, {"text": "* Summer's End", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.45164835164835165, "y1": 0.3084693084693085}, {"text": "* The Conversation", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.4758241758241758, "y1": 0.32556332556332557}, {"text": "* Cock Crow", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.3317793317793318, "x1": 0.42417582417582417, "y1": 0.3418803418803419}, {"text": "* Amy Caroline", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.4461538461538462, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "* Canberra Morning", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.3651903651903652, "x1": 0.4879120879120879, "y1": 0.37839937839937837}, {"text": "Kenneth Slessor, Selected Poems", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.578021978021978, "y1": 0.4094794094794095}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.4226884226884227, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.43512043512043513}, {"text": "* Wild Grapes", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.445998445998446, "x1": 0.4351648351648352, "y1": 0.4592074592074592}, {"text": "* Gulliver", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.46231546231546233, "x1": 0.4, "y1": 0.47241647241647244}, {"text": "* Out of Time", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.47863247863247865, "x1": 0.42967032967032964, "y1": 0.49184149184149184}, {"text": "* Vesper-Song of the Reverend Samuel Marsden", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.49572649572649574, "x1": 0.7098901098901099, "y1": 0.508935508935509}, {"text": "* William Street", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.5120435120435121, "x1": 0.44945054945054946, "y1": 0.5221445221445221}, {"text": "* Beach Burial", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.5291375291375291, "x1": 0.44065934065934065, "y1": 0.5392385392385393}, {"text": "Jane Harrison, Rainbow's End", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.5625485625485626, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.5726495726495726}, {"text": "* Drama -", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5633255633255633, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.5726495726495726}, {"text": "from Vivienne Cleven et al., Contemporary Indigenous Plays", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.5788655788655789, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.5920745920745921}, {"text": "Arthur Miller, The Crucible", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.6021756021756022, "x1": 0.5351648351648352, "y1": 0.6122766122766122}, {"text": "+ Shakespearean \u2014", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6355866355866356, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.6487956487956488}, {"text": "William Shakespeare, The Merchant of Venice", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.6363636363636364, "x1": 0.6868131868131868, "y1": 0.6495726495726496}, {"text": "Drama", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.6526806526806527, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.662004662004662}, {"text": "Section II prescribed texts continue on page 11", "x0": 0.2978021978021978, "y0": 0.703962703962704, "x1": 0.7, "y1": 0.7163947163947164}], [{"text": "Section II prescribed texts (continued)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.42857142857142855, "y1": 0.0947940947940948}, {"text": "Nonfiction", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.23186813186813188, "y1": 0.1250971250971251}, {"text": "\u2014 Tim Winton, The Boy Behind the Curtain", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.11499611499611499, "x1": 0.6461538461538462, "y1": 0.1282051282051282}, {"text": "The prescribed chapters are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.13908313908313907, "x1": 0.5362637362637362, "y1": 0.15151515151515152}, {"text": "* Havoc: A Life in Accidents", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.5516483516483517, "y1": 0.17482517482517482}, {"text": "* Betsy", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.1794871794871795, "x1": 0.3769230769230769, "y1": 0.1919191919191919}, {"text": "* Twice on Sundays", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.19502719502719504, "x1": 0.47912087912087914, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "* The Wait and the Flow", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.21134421134421136, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.22144522144522144}, {"text": "* In the Shadow of the Hospital", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.22843822843822845, "x1": 0.5758241758241758, "y1": 0.24164724164724163}, {"text": "* The Demon Shark", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.24475524475524477, "x1": 0.47912087912087914, "y1": 0.25485625485625485}, {"text": "* Barefoot in the Temple of Art", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.2618492618492618, "x1": 0.5725274725274725, "y1": 0.27505827505827507}, {"text": "\u2014 Malala Yousafzai and Christina Lamb, J am Malala", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.29526029526029524, "x1": 0.7296703296703296, "y1": 0.30691530691530694}, {"text": "~\u2014 Stephen Daldry, Billy Elliot", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.32867132867132864, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.3418803418803419}, {"text": "Film", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.32944832944832947, "x1": 0.1813186813186813, "y1": 0.33877233877233875}, {"text": "\u2014 Ivan O\u2019Mahoney, Go Back to Where You Came From", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.3620823620823621, "x1": 0.7461538461538462, "y1": 0.3752913752913753}, {"text": "Media", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.3628593628593629, "x1": 0.1967032967032967, "y1": 0.37218337218337216}, {"text": "The prescribed episodes are:", "x0": 0.3087912087912088, "y0": 0.3861693861693862, "x1": 0.5384615384615384, "y1": 0.3986013986013986}, {"text": "* Series 1: Episodes 1, 2 and 3", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4087024087024087, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.4219114219114219}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.33406593406593404, "y0": 0.4296814296814297, "x1": 0.36153846153846153, "y1": 0.439005439005439}, {"text": "* The Response", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4491064491064491, "x1": 0.44395604395604393, "y1": 0.46231546231546233}, {"text": "\u2014 Lucy Walker, Waste Land", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.4825174825174825, "x1": 0.5230769230769231, "y1": 0.49572649572649574}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44395604395604393, "y0": 0.5501165501165501, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.5625485625485626}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2024 NSW Edueation Standards Authority", "x0": 0.3824175824175824, "y0": 0.9673659673659674, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.9751359751359752}], [{"text": "GOVERNMENT", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.22527472527472528, "y1": 0.16705516705516704}, {"text": "NSW Education Standards Authority", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.19114219114219114, "x1": 0.4725274725274725, "y1": 0.20512820512820512}, {"text": "2024 | HIGHER SCHOOL CERTIFICATE EXAMINATION", "x0": 0.12747252747252746, "y0": 0.30691530691530694, "x1": 0.5868131868131868, "y1": 0.331002331002331}, {"text": "English Advanced", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.3877233877233877, "x1": 0.5461538461538461, "y1": 0.4226884226884227}, {"text": "Paper 1 \u2014 Texts and Human Experiences", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.45376845376845376, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.48484848484848486}, {"text": "Stimulus Booklet", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5182595182595182, "x1": 0.3901098901098901, "y1": 0.5384615384615384}, {"text": "Page", "x0": 0.8351648351648352, "y0": 0.5843045843045843, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5975135975135976}, {"text": "Section! + Text 1 \u2014 Nonfiction extract 2", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.60994560994561, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.6363636363636364}, {"text": "+ Text 2 \u2014 Nonfiction extract 3", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.6534576534576535, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.6635586635586636}, {"text": "+ Text 3 \u2014 Prose fiction extract 4", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.6876456876456877, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.6977466977466977}, {"text": "* Text 4 \u2014 Photograph 4", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.7226107226107226, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.7358197358197358}, {"text": "Text 5 \u2014 5", "x0": 0.2824175824175824, "y0": 0.7567987567987567, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.7668997668997669}, {"text": "+ Text 6 \u2014 Prose fiction extract 6", "x0": 0.2681318681318681, "y0": 0.7917637917637917, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.8018648018648019}, {"text": "1033", "x0": 0.08241758241758242, "y0": 0.9463869463869464, "x1": 0.11758241758241758, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "Text 1 \u2014 Nonfiction extract", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.36153846153846153, "y1": 0.09246309246309246}], [{"text": "Text 2\u2014", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.2, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "extract", "x0": 0.3010989010989011, "y0": 0.08313908313908314, "x1": 0.36043956043956044, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "The very first measurement, like the first word or first melody, is lost to", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.13131313131313133, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "time: impossible to localise and difficult even to imagine. Yet it was a hugely", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.16161616161616163}, {"text": "significant act: another addition to that nest of primeval!!! consciousness", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.17793317793317792}, {"text": "that grew in the brains of our ancestors hundreds of thousands of years ago,", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.18104118104118105, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.19425019425019424}, {"text": "and that would eventually set us apart from the other animals of the plain.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "For measurement, like speech and play, is the cornerstone of", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.21445221445221446, "x1": 0.7032967032967034, "y1": 0.22766122766122765}, {"text": "It encourages us to pay attention to the boundaries of the world, to notice", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "where the line ends and the scales tip. It requires that we compare one", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.26107226107226106}, {"text": "portion of reality to another and describe the differences, creating a scaffold", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.26495726495726496, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "for knowledge ... If we could not measure, then we could not observe the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2812742812742813, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.29448329448329447}, {"text": "world around us; could not experiment and learn. Measurement allows us", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.29914529914529914, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.31157731157731156}, {"text": "to record the past and by doing so uncover patterns that help predict the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3146853146853147, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.3278943278943279}, {"text": "future. And finally, it is a tool of social cohesion and control, letting us", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3317793317793318, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "coordinate individual effort into something greater than the sum of its parts.", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.3480963480963481, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.3613053613053613}, {"text": "Measurement has not only made the world we live in, it has made us too.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.3644133644133644, "x1": 0.7857142857142857, "y1": 0.3776223776223776}, {"text": "I first began to realise the importance of measurement when writing about", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.41181041181041184}, {"text": "the redefinition of the kilogram as a journalist in 2018. I had travelled to Paris", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.4149184149184149, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "for the assignment, and there interviewed scientists who had been working", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.43123543123543123, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.4444444444444444}, {"text": "on the project for decades as part of the International Bureau of Weights and", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.46153846153846156}, {"text": "Measures, the organisation that oversees the metric system. They explained", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.46464646464646464, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.47785547785547783}, {"text": "how, since the eighteenth century, the kilogram had been defined as the", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.48174048174048173, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.494949494949495}, {"text": "weight of a particular lump of metal: an actual physical artefact, kept under", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.49805749805749805, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.5112665112665112}, {"text": "lock and key in an underground vault in France. Every weight in the world", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5151515151515151, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5283605283605284}, {"text": "(even the non-metric ones) could be traced back to this single standard, to", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5314685314685315, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.5446775446775447}, {"text": "the kilogram ...", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5485625485625486, "x1": 0.31758241758241756, "y1": 0.5617715617715617}, {"text": "The existence of this hidden world was a revelation. I felt like I had opened", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.581973581973582, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5951825951825952}, {"text": "the door of my flat one morning only to step out on to the surface of an alien", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.5982905982905983, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.6114996114996115}, {"text": "planet, surrounded suddenly by strange trees and the cries of unfamiliar", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6153846153846154, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.6285936285936286}, {"text": "animals. The idea that something as fundamental and commonplace as a unit", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6317016317016317, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.6449106449106449}, {"text": "of measurement was even capable of change was thrilling, and the more I", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.6480186480186481, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.6612276612276612}, {"text": "learned, the more questions I had. Why is a kilogram a kilogram, anyway?", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6651126651126651, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.6783216783216783}, {"text": "Why an inch an inch? Who first decided these values and who maintains", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6814296814296814, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.6946386946386947}, {"text": "them now?", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.6993006993006993, "x1": 0.27912087912087913, "y1": 0.7086247086247086}, {"text": "As I followed these breadcrumbs, I began to understand what an", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.7319347319347319, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.7451437451437452}, {"text": "intellectual feast measurement truly is, what a banquet of historical, scientific,", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7482517482517482, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.7614607614607615}, {"text": "and sociological wonder.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.7653457653457654, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.7785547785547785}, {"text": "JAMES VINCENT", "x0": 0.6835164835164835, "y0": 0.7995337995337995, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.8088578088578089}, {"text": "Beyond Measure", "x0": 0.6725274725274726, "y0": 0.815073815073815, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.8282828282828283}, {"text": "Beyond Measure: The Hidden History of Measurement by James Vincent, Faber and Faber Ltd", "x0": 0.24725274725274726, "y0": 0.8414918414918415, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.8508158508158508}, {"text": "1 primeval ancient", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.8694638694638694, "x1": 0.3824175824175824, "y1": 0.8811188811188811}, {"text": "1 cognition the mental processing of information", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.8865578865578866, "x1": 0.5813186813186814, "y1": 0.8982128982128982}], [{"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.3791208791208791, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "A times these days I think of the way the sun would set on the farmland around", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "our small house in the autumn. A view of the horizon, the whole entire circle of it,", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.14840714840714841, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "if you turned, the sun setting behind you, the sky in front becoming pink and soft,", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.16472416472416473, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.17793317793317792}, {"text": "then slightly blue again, as though it could not stop going on in its beauty, then the", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.18104118104118105, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.19425019425019424}, {"text": "land closest to the setting sun would get dark, almost black against the orange line", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "of horizon, but if you turn around, the land is still available to the eye with such", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.21445221445221446, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.22766122766122765}, {"text": "softness, the few trees, the quiet field of cover crops already turned, and the sky", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "lingering, lingering, then finally dark. As though the soul can be quiet for those", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.26107226107226106}, {"text": "moments.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.24505494505494504, "y1": 0.27505827505827507}, {"text": "All life amazes me.", "x0": 0.1912087912087912, "y0": 0.2812742812742813, "x1": 0.34725274725274724, "y1": 0.2913752913752914}, {"text": "ELIZABETH STROUT", "x0": 0.6802197802197802, "y0": 0.3014763014763015, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.3108003108003108}, {"text": "My Name is Lucy Barton", "x0": 0.6296703296703297, "y0": 0.3177933177933178, "x1": 0.8318681318681319, "y1": 0.33022533022533024}, {"text": "\u2018An excerpt from My name is Lucy Barton \u00a9 Elizabeth Strout (2016)", "x0": 0.43736263736263736, "y0": 0.34265734265734266, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.351981351981352}, {"text": "Used by permission of Random House - an imprint and division of Penguin Random House LLC.", "x0": 0.26593406593406593, "y0": 0.3543123543123543, "x1": 0.8340659340659341, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}, {"text": "All rights reserved", "x0": 0.7263736263736263, "y0": 0.3651903651903652, "x1": 0.832967032967033, "y1": 0.3745143745143745}, {"text": "Text 4 \u2014 Photograph", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4063714063714064, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.4195804195804196}, {"text": "Courtesy of Florian Schroeder", "x0": 0.6516483516483517, "y0": 0.9222999222999223, "x1": 0.8296703296703297, "y1": 0.9316239316239316}], [{"text": "Text 5\u2014 Poem", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.25164835164835164, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "Lockley\u2019s Pylon!!!", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.13131313131313133, "x1": 0.4956043956043956, "y1": 0.14763014763014762}, {"text": "Running", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.17094017094017094, "x1": 0.3879120879120879, "y1": 0.18337218337218336}, {"text": "hunched over and wet", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.1895881895881896, "x1": 0.4967032967032967, "y1": 0.1989121989121989}, {"text": "between thunder claps and lightning", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.20745920745920746, "x1": 0.6120879120879121, "y1": 0.22066822066822067}, {"text": "\u2014on my path,", "x0": 0.3208791208791209, "y0": 0.22766122766122765, "x1": 0.4351648351648352, "y1": 0.2400932400932401}, {"text": "emerging out of mist", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.24553224553224554, "x1": 0.4879120879120879, "y1": 0.25874125874125875}, {"text": "symmetric blooms", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.26495726495726496, "x1": 0.46813186813186813, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "on hectic zig zag branches,", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.2836052836052836, "x1": 0.5384615384615384, "y1": 0.29681429681429683}, {"text": "burnt black and", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.30303030303030304, "x1": 0.44395604395604393, "y1": 0.31313131313131315}, {"text": "hung with crystal-beaded spider webs.", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.32167832167832167, "x1": 0.6296703296703297, "y1": 0.3348873348873349}, {"text": "Yawning above,", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.3418803418803419, "x1": 0.45164835164835165, "y1": 0.3543123543123543}, {"text": "great waves", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.3620823620823621, "x1": 0.4142857142857143, "y1": 0.372960372960373}, {"text": "of half-swallowed sandstone", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.37839937839937837, "x1": 0.5494505494505495, "y1": 0.3885003885003885}, {"text": "pull at me\u2014", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.3978243978243978, "x1": 0.4175824175824176, "y1": 0.411033411033411}, {"text": "beside the track", "x0": 0.31868131868131866, "y0": 0.4172494172494173, "x1": 0.44505494505494503, "y1": 0.42657342657342656}, {"text": "fresh Isopogon anemonifolia!\u201d!", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.567032967032967, "y1": 0.4491064491064491}, {"text": "like small yellow fireworks", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.45454545454545453, "x1": 0.5406593406593406, "y1": 0.4677544677544678}, {"text": "outwards,", "x0": 0.4153846153846154, "y0": 0.47474747474747475, "x1": 0.49340659340659343, "y1": 0.48484848484848486}, {"text": "minute opalescent!*! pearls podded inside", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.4902874902874903, "x1": 0.6538461538461539, "y1": 0.5058275058275058}, {"text": "the unfurling fronds of ferns.", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.5120435120435121, "x1": 0.5538461538461539, "y1": 0.5252525252525253}, {"text": "Soaked with rain", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.5306915306915307, "x1": 0.45494505494505494, "y1": 0.5407925407925408}, {"text": "scared,", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.5501165501165501, "x1": 0.3747252747252747, "y1": 0.560994560994561}, {"text": "stumbling and breathless", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.5687645687645687, "x1": 0.5186813186813187, "y1": 0.581973581973582}, {"text": "for one moment", "x0": 0.3153846153846154, "y0": 0.5874125874125874, "x1": 0.4461538461538462, "y1": 0.6006216006216006}, {"text": "1am immeasurably happy.", "x0": 0.31978021978021975, "y0": 0.6076146076146076, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.62004662004662}, {"text": "FAYE WILSON", "x0": 0.5692307692307692, "y0": 0.6456876456876457, "x1": 0.6791208791208792, "y1": 0.655011655011655}, {"text": "\u00a9 Faye Wilson", "x0": 0.5934065934065934, "y0": 0.6674436674436675, "x1": 0.6802197802197802, "y1": 0.6767676767676768}, {"text": "{11 Lockley\u2019s Pylon name of a bush walking track", "x0": 0.23186813186813188, "y0": 0.6930846930846931, "x1": 0.6681318681318681, "y1": 0.7156177156177156}, {"text": "(21 Isopogon anemonifolia small yellow-flowered shrub", "x0": 0.23186813186813188, "y0": 0.7156177156177156, "x1": 0.6604395604395604, "y1": 0.7272727272727273}, {"text": "81 whorling", "x0": 0.23186813186813188, "y0": 0.7327117327117327, "x1": 0.3098901098901099, "y1": 0.7451437451437452}, {"text": "spiralling movement", "x0": 0.4703296703296703, "y0": 0.7350427350427351, "x1": 0.6065934065934065, "y1": 0.7451437451437452}, {"text": "{41 opalescent milky brightness", "x0": 0.23186813186813188, "y0": 0.7498057498057498, "x1": 0.5791208791208792, "y1": 0.7622377622377622}], [{"text": "Text 6 \u2014 Prose fiction extract", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.3791208791208791, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "They were an old [local] family whose fortune had not kept up with their name. It had", "x0": 0.14725274725274726, "y0": 0.13131313131313133, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "taken three generations of failed politicians and novelists to reduce them to a state", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.1452991452991453, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.16472416472416473}, {"text": "of dignified precariousness. Their house on Pearl Street, one of the first built in the", "x0": 0.14725274725274726, "y0": 0.16472416472416473, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.17793317793317792}, {"text": "city, was the very embodiment of that dignity, and Leopold and Catherine Brevoort\u2019s", "x0": 0.14725274725274726, "y0": 0.18104118104118105, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.19425019425019424}, {"text": "existence revolved, to a large extent, around its upkeep. By the time Helen was born,", "x0": 0.14725274725274726, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "they had closed down the upper floors to make sure they could give the lower ones,", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.21445221445221446, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.22766122766122765}, {"text": "where they entertained, their full attention ... If their gatherings were so successful, it", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.24475524475524477}, {"text": "was because they achieved a rare balance between lightness (Catherine had a knack for", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.26107226107226106}, {"text": "making others feel like gifted conversationalists) and gravitas!!! (Leopold was widely", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.2618492618492618, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.27816627816627815}, {"text": "acknowledged as one of the local intellectual and moral authorities).", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.2812742812742813, "x1": 0.7021978021978021, "y1": 0.29448329448329447}, {"text": "[Mr Brevoort had penned] two volumes on political philosophy. Embittered by", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3146853146853147, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.3278943278943279}, {"text": "the perfect silence that met his work, he turned to his young daughter and took her", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3317793317793318, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.34498834498834496}, {"text": "schooling in his hands. Since Helen\u2019s birth, Mr Brevoort had been too preoccupied with", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3480963480963481, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.3613053613053613}, {"text": "his failing affairs to pay any serious attention to her, but now that he had decided to", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3651903651903652, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.37839937839937837}, {"text": "take charge of her education, he delighted in every facet of her personality. At age five,", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3815073815073815, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.3947163947163947}, {"text": "she was already an avid reader, and her father was surprised to find in her a precocious", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.41181041181041184}, {"text": "interlocutor\u201d!, They went for long walks alone along the [river], sometimes well into", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.41181041181041184, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "the night, discussing the natural phenomena around them\u2014tadpoles and constellations,", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.43123543123543123, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.4444444444444444}, {"text": "falling leaves and the winds carrying them, the moon\u2019s halo and the stag\u2019s antlers.", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.4483294483294483, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.46153846153846156}, {"text": "Leopold had never experienced this sort of joy.", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.46464646464646464, "x1": 0.5307692307692308, "y1": 0.47785547785547783}, {"text": "He found all the available schoolbooks insufficient, questioning both their content", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.49805749805749805, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.5112665112665112}, {"text": "and pedagogical!) approach. Therefore, when he was not teaching or tending to the", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.5120435120435121, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5283605283605284}, {"text": "social obligations his wife always seemed to create for him, Mr Brevoort was busy", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.5314685314685315, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5446775446775447}, {"text": "writing manuals and composing workbooks for his daughter. They contained instructive", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.5485625485625486, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5617715617715617}, {"text": "games, riddles, and puzzles that Helen enjoyed and almost invariably solved. Along", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.5648795648795649, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.578088578088578}, {"text": "with science, literature was featured prominently in their education program ... With", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.581973581973582, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5951825951825952}, {"text": "the aid of obsolete dictionaries, they attempted the translation of tales and fables from", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.5982905982905983, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.6114996114996115}, {"text": "Scandinavia, ancient Rome, and Greece. Encouraged by the utterly absurd result of", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6153846153846154, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.6285936285936286}, {"text": "their efforts (Mrs Brevoort often had to break into their little study to ask them to", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6317016317016317, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.6449106449106449}, {"text": "stop laughing \u201clike horses\u201d when she was entertaining), they started a collection of", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6480186480186481, "x1": 0.8527472527472527, "y1": 0.6612276612276612}, {"text": "fabricated, outrageous myths. The first two or three years of Helen\u2019s studies under her", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6651126651126651, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.6783216783216783}, {"text": "father\u2019s would remain the happiest in her life, and even if, in time, the details", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6814296814296814, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.6946386946386947}, {"text": "and contours of these memories faded, the general feeling of excitement and plenitude!*!", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.6954156954156954, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.7117327117327117}, {"text": "remained as bright and vivid as ever in her mind.", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.7148407148407149, "x1": 0.5461538461538461, "y1": 0.728049728049728}, {"text": "HERNAN Diaz", "x0": 0.7406593406593407, "y0": 0.749028749028749, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.7583527583527584}, {"text": "Trust", "x0": 0.8098901098901099, "y0": 0.7661227661227661, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.7754467754467754}, {"text": "From Trust, first published in the UK in 2022 by Picador, an imprint of Pan Macmillan.", "x0": 0.34945054945054943, "y0": 0.7793317793317793, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.8010878010878011}, {"text": "Reproduced by permission of Macmillan Publishers International Limited. \u00a9 Hernan Diaz 2022", "x0": 0.2967032967032967, "y0": 0.7964257964257965, "x1": 0.8549450549450549, "y1": 0.8057498057498057}, {"text": "1 gravitas seriousness", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.818958818958819, "x1": 0.3912087912087912, "y1": 0.8313908313908314}, {"text": "1 interlocutor conversationalist", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.8360528360528361, "x1": 0.42967032967032964, "y1": 0.8461538461538461}, {"text": "Pl pedagogical educational", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.853923853923854, "x1": 0.3934065934065934, "y1": 0.8655788655788655}, {"text": "141 tutelage instruction", "x0": 0.14835164835164835, "y0": 0.871017871017871, "x1": 0.38571428571428573, "y1": 0.8826728826728827}, {"text": "plenitude abundance", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.8896658896658897, "x1": 0.3868131868131868, "y1": 0.8997668997668997}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2024 NSW Edueation Standards Authority", "x0": 0.3824175824175824, "y0": 0.9673659673659674, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.9751359751359752}]]